<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chikalata cha Paolo kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chikalata chi che Paolo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Che Filimoni</para>
  <para style="mt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha mwana chi che Filimoni chilembekwe ni nduna che Paolo, (1:1). Che Paolo ŵaliji ataŵikwe katema paŵalembile chitabu chi, malumbo gakwe ikukomboleka ŵalembile chitabu chi ku Loma. Iŵaga ŵaliji ku Loma, nipele chalembekwe yaka ya 61 pakumala kupagwa Kilisito, kali katema kakoko kaŵalembile chitabu cha Ŵakolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŵannembele chikalata chi mundu jumo jwakuŵilanjikwa che Filimoni. Che Filimoni ŵaliji jumo jwa ŵandu ŵakwakulupilila Che Yesu, ni iyoyo ŵaliji ni kapolo jwakwe juŵaŵilanjikwe che Onesmo. Che Paolo ŵannembele che Filimoni kunchondelela kuti akanjamuka che Onesimo kapolo jwakwe juŵautwiche kutyochela ku che Filimoni. Kwa malajisyo ga umwenye wa Chiloma che Filimoni akakombwele kummulaga che Onesimo. Che Paolo ŵanyenjile che filimoni kwa kunlimbisya ntima ankunde che Onesimo nti Mkilisito njakwe, iyoyo peyo che Paolo akummenda che Filimoni annechelele che Onesimo kuti ŵakamuchisye che Paolo kwa chiŵandi, (1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Paolo akunkomasya che Filimoni (1:1-3).</para>
  <para style="io">Che Paolo akunchondelela che Filimoni ampochele che Onesimo nti Mkilisito njakwe (1:4-21).</para>
  <para style="io">Che Paolo akumalichisya kwa kwasalila kwa chichi akusaka kwajimajimila ni kwakomasya (1:22-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Une che Paolo jundaŵikwe kwa ligongo lya kwatumichila Che Yesu Kilisito. Une pamo ni che Timoseo nlongo njetu, tukunnembela alakwe che Filimoni jwakunonyelwa jwetu, ni junkupanganya masengo pamo nowe, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>ni kwa mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito wose waukusongangana mu nyuumba jenu, ni kwa alumbu ŵetu che Afia ni kwa che Alikipo jwangondo njetu.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Tukunsachilanga umbone ni chitendewele kutyochela kwa Akunnungu Atati ŵetu, ni Ambuje ŵetu Che Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Unonyelo ni chikulupi chi che Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Nlongo njangu che Filimoni, katema kose pangupopela, ngunkumbuchila mmwe, ni kwatogolela Akunnungu ŵangu, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>pakuŵa ngupilikana inkuti pakwakulupilila Ambuje Che Yesu ni inkuti pakwanonyela ŵandu wose ŵa Akunnungu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Ngumpopelela kwa Akunnungu kuti mme ni machili ga kwasalila ŵandu ŵane chikulupi chenu, kuti akombole kumanyilila indu yambone itukwete uwe ŵatulumbikene ni Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Nlongo njangu, unonyelo wenu usengwasisye kwannope ni kulimbisya ntima. Pakuŵa njisengwasisye mitima ja ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Che Paolo akwaŵenda che Filimoni nkati che Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Kwa ligongo lyo, naŵaga nlongo njenu nkulumbikana ni Kilisito, ngakombwele kunnajisya pangali lipamba mpanganye chinkusachilwa kuchipanganya, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>nambo kwa ligongo lya unonyelo, mmbaya nammende. Ngutenda yeleyi namuno uneji che Paolo jundi jwanchekulwipe, ni sambano ndaŵikwe kwa liwamba lya Che Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Kwayele ngunchondelela munkamuchisye che Onesimo jwali mwanangu nkulumbikana ni Kilisito. Pakuŵa ndili atatigwe chimbumu kutyochela patwaliji pamo mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Jwelejo kalakala nganakola masengo kukwenu, nambo sambano akwete masengo kukwenu ni kukwangu.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Sambano ngummusya kukwenu, namuno ngwanonyela kwannope. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Ngasachile atame none papapa kuti angamuchisye pamalo penu pandili jwantawe ligongo naliji nkulalichila Ngani Jambone. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Ngangusaka kunkanganichisya mungamuchisye, nambo ngusaka mpanganye inkuti pakusaka mwasyene. Kwayele ngangupanganya chachilichose mpaka pachinsache.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Panepa lyeleli lili ligongo, che Onesimo ŵalekangene ni mmwe kwa katema, kuti auje sooni kukwenu ni kutama ni jwelejo moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Sambano jwelejo nganaŵa kapolo sooni nambo jwambone kumpunda kapolo, sambano jwelejo ali nlongo nkulumbikana ni Kilisito. Jwelejo ali jwambone nnope kwangune, nombe kukwenu chaŵe ŵambone mwakupunda, pakuŵa jwelejo ali njetu ni nlongo njenu kwa chiilu ni nkulumbikana ni Ambuje.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Nipele, iŵaga nkuumona ndili jwamasengo njenu, mumpochele che Onesmo mpela inkatite pakuumbochela une nansyene. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Iŵaga anneŵele chachili chose, pane akwete ligambo, chinanlipe. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Une che Paolo ngulemba kwa nkono wangu nansyene kuti chilipe. Ngangusachilwa kunkumbusya kuti nkwete magambo kukwangu lyalili umi wenu. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Kwayele, nlongo njangu, ngunchondelela mungamuchisye kwa litala li kwa liwamba lya Ambuje, sambano nti nlongo njangu nkulumbikana ni Kilisito, muunonyelesye ntima wangu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Ngunnembela njimanyililaga kuti chimumbilikanile, sooni ngumanyilila isyene kuti chimumpanganyichisye yakupunda ni ingusala yi. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Pamo ni yose yi, mumichile chile chuumba chakugona, pakuŵa ngulolela kuti Akunnungu chajanje mapopelo genu ni une chinechelelwe ni chinanjimajimile.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chikomasyo cha kumalichisya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Che Epafula jwantawe pamo ni une kwa ligongo lya kwatumichila Kilisito Yesu akunkomasya. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Iyoyo che Maliko ni che Alisitako ni che Dema ni che Luka ŵakutumichila achinjangu akunkomasya.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Umbone wa Ambuje ŵetu Che Yesu Kilisito uŵe pamo ni ŵanyamwe wose.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
